Always have.

342
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,900
这不是真心话吧 查莉蒂姑姑
You can't mean that, Aunt Charity.

343
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:32,740
在你出生前 我曾是家里的小公主
Up until you were born, I was the family princess.

344
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:35,900
你出生后 所有人都觉得你"棒棒棒"
And then you came in, and you got the boom boom boom.

345
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:37,900
你抢走了我的"棒棒棒"
And you took my boom boom boom.

346
00:14:38,300 --> 00:14:40,620
所以我把你锁进房间间间
So I locked you in a room room room.

347
00:14:41,860 --> 00:14:45,680
抱歉让你觉得 是我抢走了你的"棒棒棒"
Well, I'm sorry you think I took your boom boom boom,

348
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:47,720
但你真的拿走了我的海鸥杯
but you really did take my seagull cup

349
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:48,780
还把我锁进房间
and lock me in a room.

350
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:49,920
间间
Room room.

351
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:53,120
我可不会给你一分钱的 小姑娘
I'm not giving you any money, little girl.

352
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:53,960
我丑话说在先
Just so you know.

353
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:56,600
或许你尝过我们的小蛋糕后
Well, maybe you'll feel differently

354
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:58,500
你会改变你的想法
after you taste one of our cupcakes.

355
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:00,900
来 我们何不花时间尝一口
Here, why don't we take a minute for a little bite?

356
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:02,400
不 我不想吃
Nope, I don't want it.

357
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:04,880
它会让你知道 投资我们绝对错不了
It'll show you what a good business investment we are.

358
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,880
来 吃一口 过来
Here, come--come here.

359
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:08,940
就尝一口嘛
Just--oh--just taste it.

360
00:15:08,940 --> 00:15:09,800
来
Here.

361
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:11,740
拜托 尝尝 吃一口
Come on, taste-take a bite.

362
00:15:11,900 --> 00:15:13,240
这场面真让人不舒服
This is pretty disturbing.

363
00:15:14,540 --> 00:15:16,120
如果我现在不是爽翻天
I would intervene right now

364
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:18,040
我早过去阻止你了
if I wasn't feeling amazing.

365
00:15:19,820 --> 00:15:20,700
很好吃 对吧
Yummy, right?

366
00:15:21,380 --> 00:15:22,780
不 不 不
Oh, no, no, no, no.

367
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:23,680
不要啊 那是你的脸
No, no, no, that's your face.

368
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,240
我觉得你嚼的是你的脸皮
I think you're chewing your face.

369
00:15:27,340 --> 00:15:29,360
那是我吃过最好吃的小蛋糕
That's the best cupcake I have ever had,

370
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:32,260
但我还是不会给你一分钱的
But I am still not giving you any money.

371
00:15:33,220 --> 00:15:35,060
为什么 这是你摔烂我的海鸥杯后
Why not? It's the least you could do

372
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:36,600
唯一能补偿我的机会
after you broke my seagull cup.

373
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:39,740
天啊 你还要提你那个海鸥杯吗
Oh, my god, are you still talking about that seagull cup?

374
00:15:40,100 --> 00:15:42,440
我都15年没想到它了
I haven't thought about that in 15 years.

375
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:45,340
如果我们要讨论那个白痴海鸥杯
If we're gonna be talking about that stupid seagull cup,

376
00:15:45,420 --> 00:15:46,900
那我得再吃一根棒棒糖
I'm gonna need another lollipop.

377
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:49,740
她把糖放哪里了
Where does she keep them?

378
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:54,220
这里 装在一个有海鸥的杯子里
Oh, here, they're in this cup that has a seagull on it.

379
00:15:55,700 --> 00:15:56,220
慢着
Wait.

380
00:15:57,280 --> 00:15:59,520
我之前在哪里听说过海鸥杯来着
Where have I heard of seagull cup before?

381
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:03,580
那是我的晚安可可杯
That's my night-night cocoa cup.

382
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,000
我就知道它没有摔烂
I knew it wasn't broken.

383
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:07,480
你居然偷偷藏了这么多年
You hid it and kept it all these years?

384
00:16:07,780 --> 00:16:08,200
你奈我何
Yep.

385
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:11,100
为什么你要这样伤害我
Why would you want to hurt me like that?

386
00:16:11,580 --> 00:16:12,580
还不够明显吗
It's obvious.

387
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,400
她迷恋自己的哥哥
She's obsessed with her brother,

388
00:16:14,420 --> 00:16:15,760
她把你的出生视为
and she saw your being born

389
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,900
抢走她哥哥所有的爱
as his love being taken away from her.

390
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,080
靠 这玩意让老娘一秒钟变聪明
Damn, this thing makes me smart.

391
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:23,860
希望你现在开心了
Well, I hope you're happy now,

392
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:26,400
因为我失去的不只是这个晚安可可杯
because I lost a lot more than my night-night cocoa cup.

393
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,040
我失去我的家产 我的父亲
I lost my money, my father,

394
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:29,520
现在我还即将失去我的梦想
and now I'm about to lose my dream.

395
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:30,920
告诉你 我们走人了
And you know what? We're done.

396
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:33,040
你想得美 才不走
You know what? We are not done.

397
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:34,300
我不是个轻易放弃的人
I am not a quitter.

398
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:36,360
我说过会帮你把面膜贴上
I said I would put your new face on,

399
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:38,480
所以没做到我决不离开
so I'm not leaving here until I do.

400
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:42,080
她的脸没了
Her face is gone.

401
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:44,380
她简直就是钱宁家的《歌剧魅影》
She's basically the phantom of the Channing.

402
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:51,020
好了 这样应该差不多了
All right, that's close enough.

403
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:55,100
别再说我是被宠坏的孩子
And stop calling me spoiled.

404
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:57,260
自从我失去了一切 我努力工作
Since I lost it all, I've worked hard.

405
00:16:57,460 --> 00:16:59,420
我打扫过厕所 打死过老鼠
I've cleaned toilets, I've killed rats,

406
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:01,820
我为了成功 什么都愿意做
I've done everything I had to to be a success.

407
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:02,940
告诉她 麦克斯
Tell her, Max.

408
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:04,660
我感觉很棒棒棒 *
* I got that boom boom boom

409
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:06,680
-我感觉很棒... -算了 我们走
- I got that boom- - Okay, fine. Let's go.

410
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,540
站住
Stop.

411
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:10,340
好 我会给你钱
Fine, I'll give you the money.

412
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:13,260
不是因为你是我的侄女
Not--not just because you're my niece,

413
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:18,360
而是因为你强迫自己来这里
but because you forced yourself in here

414
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:21,660
像一个强卖的女商人 我是指
like a pushy businesswoman, which is--

415
00:17:21,660 --> 00:17:23,920
你把蛋糕硬塞进我喉咙[硬要我接受]
you shoved your cupcake down my throat.

416
00:17:24,820 --> 00:17:27,560
因为换做是我 我也会做同样的事
That is exactly what I would have done.

417
00:17:32,072 --> 00:17:38,368
签名 查莉蒂·钱...
Signed Char-ity Chan...

418
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:39,420
天啊
Oh, no.

419
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:41,200
查莉蒂姑姑 你还好吧
Aunt Charity, are you all right?

420
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:44,260
她没有签完她的名字
Oh, and she didn't finish signing it.

421
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:48,640
不过那也是我的姓 那就我代劳吧
Well, it's my last name too, so...

422
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:48,900
宁
Ing.

423
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,960
她的头压住了 我拿不出来
I can't get it out from under her head.

424
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,660
扯她的头发 你报仇的机会来了
Pull her hair! Now's your chance.

425
00:18:05,340 --> 00:18:07,460
鲍勃 我觉得你没有表达清
Bob, I don't feel you are getting across

426
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:09,780
我的愤怒之情 我自己比手语吧
my passion about this, so I'll just sign it.

427
00:18:09,940 --> 00:18:11,640
那张支票应该能兑现的
That check should have cleared.

428
00:18:12,580 --> 00:18:14,980
你刚才的手语是说 "你的脸长得像屁股"
That time, you said, "Your face looks like a butt."

429
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:20,280
我很欣赏你们为了继续经营而做出的努力
I appreciate how hard you've tried to stay in business,

430
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,620
但好汉不吃眼前亏
but do the smart thing.

431
00:18:21,760 --> 00:18:23,680
收下这笔钱 重新开始
Take the money. Start fresh.

432
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:26,040
你们只需签了这份合同
All you have to do is sign this.

433
00:18:26,800 --> 00:18:28,320
我们俩需要时间讨论
Well, we will have to discuss it.

434
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,780
-我的搭档对此... -快签
- My partner has a be- - Just sign it.

435
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:30,360
讨论完毕
Good discussion.

436
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:37,340
卡洛琳·钱
Caroline Chan--

437
00:18:37,340 --> 00:18:38,240
麦克斯 帮帮我
Max, a little help.

438
00:18:39,820 --> 00:18:40,220
宁
Ing.

439
00:18:41,780 --> 00:18:43,660
从这一刻开始
So, as of this moment,

440
00:18:43,820 --> 00:18:46,380
这里不再是麦克斯自制小蛋糕店了
this space is no longer Max's homemade cupcakes.

441
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:48,680
恭喜你们 也祝你们好运
Congratulations and good luck.

442
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:54,280
乔安和那个聋女人愉快地走了
Well, there goes Joanne and that deaf lady.

443
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:00,320
这箭头我们要拿走
We are keeping the arrow.

444
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:04,080
真不敢相信我姑姑会不兑现那张支票
I can't believe my aunt would stop payment on that check.

445
00:19:05,780 --> 00:19:08,360
而且干这种事后 她居然还有脸来
And I can't believe she'd show up here after she did.

446
00:19:11,580 --> 00:19:13,000
查莉蒂姑姑
Aunt Charity, do you know

447
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,640
你知道我现在怎么想你吗
what I'm thinking about you right now?

448
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:16,380
想什么 我像38岁还是39岁吗
What? I look 38 or 39,

449
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:17,140
难以判断吧
it's hard to tell?

450
00:19:19,060 --> 00:19:20,600
别表现得那么受伤嘛
Oh, don't look so wounded.

451
00:19:20,820 --> 00:19:22,200
你知道我必须取消那张支票
You know I had to stop that check.

452
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:24,640
你居然占一个神志不清的人的便宜
You took advantage of someone in a morphine haze.

453
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:27,020
如果你觉得那就是占你便宜
If you think that was being taken advantage of,

454
00:19:27,020 --> 00:19:28,600
那你肯定没有在学校誓师大会上晕倒过
you've never blacked out at a pep rally.

455
00:19:29,720 --> 00:19:32,140
没错 我是取消了那张支票 但这个给你
Yes, I stopped that check, but here.

456
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:34,600
这似乎对你很重要
This seems important to you.

457
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:35,420
以前是
Seemed.

458
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,800
那时我还是无忧无虑的富家女
Seemed when I was rich.

459
00:19:37,940 --> 00:19:39,500
而现在 我有实际问题要解决
Now I have real problems.

460
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,420
就是 里面的棒棒糖呢
Yeah, and where are them lollipops at?

461
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:46,180
-你剥夺了我的未来 -还有我的棒棒糖
- You took away my future. - And my lollipops.

462
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:49,440
不 卡洛琳 我剥夺的只是我的钱
No, Caroline, I took away my money.

463
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:51,320
通过强迫你自己寻找出路
And by forcing you to find you own way,

464
00:19:51,320 --> 00:19:52,900
我可能会还给你一个更好的将来
I may have given you a better future.

465
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:54,860
店挺可爱
Cute shop.

466
00:19:55,220 --> 00:19:56,420
但店面太大 开得太早
Too big, too soon.

467
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:57,840
你总有一天会明白的
You'll figure it out.

468
00:20:00,520 --> 00:20:01,280
查莉蒂姑姑
Aunt Charity?

469
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:04,240
你看起来像42岁
You look 42.

470
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:07,960
我们都知道我不像
We all know I don't.

471
00:20:13,035 --> 00:20:14,780
蛋糕店没了
The shop's over.

472
00:20:14,780 --> 00:20:17,540
我以前还坚信我们会成功
Wow, I thought for sure we'd be a success.

473
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:19,780
谁说我们不是呢
Well, who says we're not?

474
00:20:20,540 --> 00:20:22,280
开这店也有过不少开心事啊
I mean, we had some fun, right?

475
00:20:22,500 --> 00:20:24,820
我们还有了这个超酷的红箭头
And we have a cool-ass red arrow.

476
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:26,840
我们有这么多钱
And we have this big check,

477
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:28,560
足够拿来还给苏菲
which is just enough to pay back Sophie

478
00:20:28,780 --> 00:20:30,300
和其他借钱给我们的人
and everybody else we owe money to.

479
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:31,860
那倒是
That's true.

480
00:20:31,880 --> 00:20:33,820
所以我们也算是成功还清债务吧
So in a way, we're kind of success.

481
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:36,320
我们从身无分文到收支平衡
I mean, we did go from broke to broke even.

482
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:37,900
我们成功了
We nailed it.

483
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:41,540
我真希望老天能给个明确的指示
I just wish we had a clear-cut sign

484
00:20:41,540 --> 00:20:43,700
告诉我们放弃这里是明智的
that letting go of this place was the right thing to do.

485
00:20:50,010 --> 00:20:52,100
偶的天
Ehr mah gerd!

486
00:20:53,050 --> 00:20:55,600
我的晚安可可杯
My night-night cocoa cup.

487
00:20:55,600 --> 00:20:59,070
你要指示是吗 这就是你要的指示
You wanted a sign? That's your sign!

488
00:20:59,070 --> 00:21:01,550
不管碰到什么灾难 你都能安然无恙
No matter what hits you, you'll be okay.

489
00:21:05,110 --> 00:21:08,500
突然觉得买下这里的人好可怜呀
Well, I feel sorry for whoever owns this dump.
